  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your ki automatically heals you of your most grievous injuries, but at a price.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Con 13, Wis 13, Healing Chakra.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> A character that is disabled or dying can automatically and immediately (free action) convert one ki point to two hit points, even if she is not ki focused. She cannot use these converted points to heal herself above 1 hp. The points used are determined just as if the character were affected by ki damage; the character has no choice which ki points will be used to save her life. This healing automatically stabilizes the character.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/jade-feats#toc107\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
